msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:7
#: 9fceea134f94465f81c59be92c85e1f0
msgid ""
"计算 DFT-D3 色散修正，并按所选模式加到或从当前能量、力和 virial 中扣除。 适合统一训练数据是否包含 D3 "
"的标签约定，不是用于随意改善散点图。"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:11
#: 9c604589d0c74a1c89d3bcdc29aebe6b
msgid "DFT-D3 计算仅支持 CPU。即使 NEP 后端选择了 GPU，执行这项操作时也会改用 CPU。"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:14
#: ac603ddb154148cc97bc573243fa08e7
msgid "修正原理"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:16
#: f3573f73a5a14429bbe040379b3d8b31
msgid ""
"DFT-D3 用元素、原子间距和配位环境计算经验色散能 $E_{\\mathrm{D3}}$，并由其对坐标和 应变的导数得到力 $\\mathbf"
" F_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ 与 virial $\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}}$。本工具不重新做 "
"DFT，只对已有标签执行一致的加减："
msgstr ""
"This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected"
" result."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:20
#: 02b29beeae604139bae1bacd2ba9c6c6
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E' &= E+sE_{\\mathrm{D3}},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf F'_i &= \\mathbf F_i+s\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3},i},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf W' &= \\mathbf W+s\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s=\\begin{cases}+1,&\\text{加上}\\\\-1,&\\text{减去。}\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected"
" result.\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:30
#: 2c028ef9b18b4acdb72a57bee7f84fce
msgid ""
"`交换-相关泛函`决定 D3 阻尼参数，必须与原始 DFT 泛函一致；`D3 截断半径`控制色散原子对， "
"`配位数截断半径`控制配位环境计算，两者单位均为 Å。截断半径不是“精度越大越好”的普通滑块： "
"增大会提高计算量，也可能改变与原始标签约定的一致性。"
msgstr ""
"This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected"
" result."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:34
#: b4e479039e8a4a6c94917afa41551dcf
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8385
